+    ),
+
+    // Rerail patch 48: CREATE [OR REPLACE] RULE name AS ON event TO table [WHERE cond] DO
+    // [ALSO | INSTEAD] {NOTHING | command | (command; ...)}, as gram.y's RuleStmt reads it.
